flowchart TD
    User[Human user] --> UI[Streamlit interface]
    UI --> Guard[Input validation and guardrails]
    Guard --> Agent[Agent controller]
    Agent --> Plan[Plan task steps]
    Plan --> Tools{Tool selection}
    Tools -->|Retrieve| RAG[Cosine-similarity retriever]
    Tools -->|Summarize| Summary[Extractive summarizer]
    Tools -->|Debug| Debug[Debugging workflow]
    RAG --> Evidence[Ranked evidence and confidence]
    Summary --> Evidence
    Debug --> Evidence
    Evidence --> Output[Grounded answer]
    Output --> Human[Human review]
    Human -->|Feedback or correction| UI
    Agent --> Trace[JSONL execution log]
    Trace --> Tests[Automated reliability tests]
    Tests -->|Results and failures| Human
